      "category": "interaction",
      "traits": [
        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "A mitflit's self-loathing makes it easy to influence. It takes a -4 penalty to its Will DC against checks to Coerce, Demoralize, Make an Impression, and Request.",
