    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Hidden Movement",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "If Gwibble starts his turn Undetected by a creature or merely Hidden from it, that creature is Off-Guard against Gwibble's attacks until the end of Gwibble's turn."
